// The program's icon, as a resource script for `build.rs` to compile into
// nkb-gui.exe. Nothing else goes in: no version block, no manifest - the point of
// the crate that compiles this is that it adds exactly what this file says.
//
// The path is relative to this file. Resource 1 is the first icon group, and
// the first one is the icon Windows shows for the file.
1 ICON "edamame.ico"
